{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新一集《女神配對計劃 2》求愛勇者吳旭東（東東）對阮嘉敏（Mandy）的專一舉動，令他成為「花生團團寵」！東東明顯全心全意衝著Mandy而來，為了爭取與女神同枱的機會，竟在遊戲中出盡全力，一度用力過猛變成「滾地葫蘆」，連電話都飛了出來，癡情程度震驚全場！</p><p>吳旭東為Mandy仆倒變滾地葫蘆</p><p>雖然今季《女神配對計劃 2》講明「心意相通」對象隨時洗牌，但東東的目標由始至終只有一個，就是Mandy。在爭奪Kanis的「主菜飯腳」名額時，東東為了增加與Mandy同枱的機會，出盡全力衝鋒陷陣，更一度因用力過猛而失平衡，當場變成「滾地葫蘆」，連隨身的電話都飛了出來，場面雖然狼狽，但其決心卻感動了在場眾人。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_4186465796abdcf5224984.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_14973025866abdcf58040e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_21352515256abdcf606d905.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>花生團激讚專一閨密都打氣</p><p>東東的癡情舉動，花生團成員全部看在眼內，並給予極大力度的欣賞。鄧凱文直接點評：「你完全知佢 aim for what，完全係 Mandy」。而身為Mandy閨密的鄧依婷，更是被東東的努力所打動，在旁不斷為他打氣，連環大叫：「東東加油呀」、「東東好努力！」東東的專一和不懈努力，令他成功俘虜花生團，成為名副其實的「團寵」。</p><p>網民封專一王支持東東Mandy</p><p>東東的癡情行為在網上引起極大迴響，不少網民被他的專一所感動，紛紛留言力撐。「東東真係好專一，眼中只有Mandy一個！」、「睇到佢仆親嗰下好心痛，但又覺得佢好可愛！」、「呢啲男仔邊度搵？Mandy快啲揀佢啦！」、「由搶櫈到仆倒，東東真係用行動證明一切。」、「支持東東Mandy呢一對，好有火花！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_18441416806abdceeb74339.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_7537701576abdceefebabb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_9216016366abdcef417192.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_6712784686abdcefcb2d77.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_10783794146abdcf00c0f9b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_21163273266abdcf1363b8c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_20933027296abdcf176e405.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_14631613656abdcf0c76b9d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_10178849736abdcf0fc80f7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_14093719156abdcf1b1e7ee.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_17971515696abdcf1e66119.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_10230035986abdcf21f0bc6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_18547329436abdcf25aa22f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_10037337286abdcf2971007.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_10227426396abdcf2dbc8a7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_12641782446abdcf314c1a6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_5799340716abdcf352d0a6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_3185943856abdcf38806c3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_16456854336abdcf3b8a1ea.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_3226501926abdcf3e9bb1f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_11707273866abdcf41ed598.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_15423211496abdcf4621796.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_2109558386abdcf4ab31e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_9818303316abdcf4e9a8fe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T12:39:53.428033+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":905,"images":27,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}